  "messages": [
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 0,
      "offsetInSection": 196,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00000000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 2,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "In the Society of Battle Connoisseurs, most\nTrainers use Fairy-type Pokémon.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕš",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 208,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 81
    },
    {
      "displayText": "But some of us in the society adore Dragon types\ntoo!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕš",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 372,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00420075007400200073006F006D00650020006F006600200075007300200069006E002000740068006500200073006F00630069006500740079002000610064006F0072006500200044007200610067006F006E002000740079007000650073000A0074006F006F002100100002011401610000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 58
    },
    {
      "displayText": "As I’m sure you’re aware, Dragon-type Pokémon\nare weak to Dragon-, Ice-, and Fairy-type moves.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕš",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 488,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 99
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Battling with Dragon types in the Fairy-loving SBC\nleaves you forever in a disadvantaged position.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕš",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 688,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 103
    },
    {
      "displayText": "It’s rather like the relationship between Jacinthe\nand Lebanne...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕš",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 896,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004900742019007300200072006100740068006500720020006C0069006B00650020007400680065002000720065006C006100740069006F006E00730068006900700020006200650074007700650065006E0020004A006100630069006E007400680065000A0061006E00640020004C006500620061006E006E0065002E002E002E00100002011401610000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 70
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Oh, but those two really do suit each other, so...\nplease forget I mentioned anything.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕš",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 1036,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 91
    },
    {
      "displayText": "I’m afraid I’ve sidetracked us a bit. Let me get to\nmy point.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕš",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 1220,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00492019006D002000610066007200610069006400200049201900760065002000730069006400650074007200610063006B00650064002000750073002000610020006200690074002E0020004C006500740020006D0065002000670065007400200074006F000A006D007900200070006F0069006E0074002E00100002011401610000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 66
    },
    {
      "displayText": "I’d like you to battle my beloved Dragon-type\nPokémon to help them grow strong!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕš",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 1352,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 84
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Just let me know whenever you decide you would\nlike to battle.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕš",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 1520,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004A0075007300740020006C006500740020006D00650020006B006E006F00770020007700680065006E006500760065007200200079006F0075002000640065006300690064006500200079006F007500200077006F0075006C0064000A006C0069006B006500200074006F00200062006100740074006C0065002E00100002011401610000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 67
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿\n",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 1656,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF000A0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "You’ll do me the favor of battling my Dragon types,\nwon’t you?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕš",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 1668,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0059006F00752019006C006C00200064006F0020006D006500200074006800650020006600610076006F00720020006F006600200062006100740074006C0069006E00670020006D007900200044007200610067006F006E002000740079007000650073002C000A0077006F006E2019007400200079006F0075003F00100002011401610000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 67
    },
    {
      "displayText": "I sure will!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 1804,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004900200073007500720065002000770069006C006C00210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 13
    },
    {
      "displayText": "I sure won’t",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 1832,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00490020007300750072006500200077006F006E201900740000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 13
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Wh-whyever not?!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕš",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 1860,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00570068002D00770068007900650076006500720020006E006F0074003F002100100002011401610000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 21
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Be warned—my Pokémon are holding Dragon\nFangs, so their attacks will have some real bite!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕš",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 1904,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 94
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0010>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 2092,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00100000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Well...my Pokémon can still evolve yet.<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nAs I mentioned earlier, it’s no easy task raising\nDragon types in the SBC.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕš",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 2104,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 122
    },
    {
      "displayText": "I have my Pokémon hold Dragon Fangs to power\nup their attacks, but the struggle continues.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕš",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 2348,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 95
    },
    {
      "displayText": "I should have known the winner of Le Super-\nTournoi de Jacinthe would be so strong.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕš",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 19,
      "offsetInSection": 2540,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 88
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Since my Pokémon aren’t fully evolved, perhaps I\nought to have given them Eviolite to hold instead.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕš",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 20,
      "offsetInSection": 2716,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 104
    },
    {
      "displayText": "But I was persuaded by Lebanne’s motto:\n“The best defense is a good offense.”<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕš",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 21,
      "offsetInSection": 2924,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 82
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Though Lebanne can hardly talk—she can’t ever\nseem to win against Jacinthe.<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nPerhaps she should rethink that motto of hers...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕš",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 22,
      "offsetInSection": 3088,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 132
    },
    {
      "displayText": "In any case, I’d like you to have this Dragon Fang.\nThank you very much for today.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕš",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 23,
      "offsetInSection": 3352,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 87
    }
  ],
